The code is licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later (see LICENSE).

The lexical data is the Kurdish Lexicon, built with zimankit
(https://github.com/0xdolan/zimankit) and licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

The data is distributed as separate files beside the program: the compiled lexicons, and
the fixtures, tables and rules in packages/data/. packages/data/NOTICE has its full notice.
Zimanyar compiles the lexicon into its own format and keeps only the columns it needs.
